OL,3,AWho is Alejandro Betancourt, colourful
OL,4,Aoil baron behind US-Venezuela oil deal?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has called the
OL,7,Fdeal granting the US control of
OL,8,Fstrategic Venezuelan oil fields "the
OL,9,Fbiggest in history".
OL,11,FNorth American Blue Energy Partners
OL,12,F(Nabep), a company little known outside
OL,13,Fthe South American country, will
OL,14,Foversee the production and sale of 17
OL,15,Foil fields containing about 65bn
OL,16,Fbarrels of crude.
OL,18,FThe agreement has raised eyebrows to
OL,19,Fsay the least.
