OL,3,AWho is Alejandro Betancourt, colourful
OL,4,Aoil baron behind US-Venezuela oil deal?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd at the heart of it is Alejandro
OL,7,FBetancourt Lopez, the Venezuelan oil
OL,8,Fbaron who heads the Barbados-registered
OL,9,Ffirm.
